{"id":"n74181-1-7","stage":1,"title":"붙다 · 粘上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74181-1-7-1","ko":"뭔가 걷는 느낌이 이상한데?","zh":"走路的时候感觉有点奇怪啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭔가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭔가","audio":"/audio/7f3853a0ea8084aa255c.mp3"}},{"text":"걷는","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걷는","audio":"/audio/4980367f7f0f860072bf.mp3"}},{"text":"느낌이","meaning":"感觉，感受","explanation":"느낌：感觉，感受；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"느낌","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61166","senseId":"1","lemma":"느낌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느낌이","audio":"/audio/160aa45adfe9857278de.mp3"}},{"text":"이상한데?","meaning":"奇怪，古怪","explanation":"이상하다：奇怪，古怪；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"이상하다","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71167","senseId":"2","lemma":"이상하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상한데","audio":"/audio/2114e721de341fb9d4d8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"f376240a37fbad98","term":"느낌","zh":"感觉，感受","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3","entryId":"61166","definition":"身体或内心产生的情绪或情感。","pronunciation":["느낌"]},{"id":"8ccfeb4ba6659178","term":"이상하다","zh":"奇怪，古怪","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3","entryId":"71167","definition":"和原本知道的东西不同，特别或独特。","pronunciation":["이ː상하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/eb715c000e07e39d77c6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74181-1-7-2","ko":"민준아, 너 신발 바닥에 껌이 붙었어.","zh":"敏俊，你鞋底粘着口香糖呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"신발","meaning":"鞋","explanation":"신발：鞋。","readings":[{"term":"신발","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30213","senseId":"1","lemma":"신발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신발","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3"}},{"text":"바닥에","meaning":"地","explanation":"바닥：地；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닥","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62696","senseId":"1","lemma":"바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닥에","audio":"/audio/2a0877f2b7ca0b120f73.mp3"}},{"text":"껌이","meaning":"口香糖","explanation":"껌：口香糖；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"껌","audio":"/audio/a0dfa9fb3c070b03ce9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41635","senseId":"1","lemma":"껌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"껌이","audio":"/audio/939b9d54dc79345b6a89.mp3"}},{"text":"붙었어.","meaning":"粘上，吸附","explanation":"붙다：粘上，吸附；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"붙다","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74181","senseId":"1","lemma":"붙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙었어","audio":"/audio/e67bd296b67e990ba545.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"514d3c6f08937125","term":"신발","zh":"鞋","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3","entryId":"30213","definition":"站立或走路时为了保护脚而穿的东西。","pronunciation":["신발"]},{"id":"18c3f3f4b810aab6","term":"바닥","zh":"地","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3","entryId":"62696","definition":"某种空间中，下面的平坦又宽的部分。","pronunciation":["바닥"]},{"id":"a0dfa9fb3c070b03","term":"껌","zh":"口香糖","audio":"/audio/a0dfa9fb3c070b03ce9d.mp3","entryId":"41635","definition":"一种可以放入口中长时间咀嚼、吃掉甜味后吐掉的糖果。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"25c69080a9810c70","term":"붙다","zh":"粘上，吸附","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3","entryId":"74181","definition":"某物附在某处而不脱落。","pronunciation":["붇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/99fab306867458e2bcb8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.593,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74181","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":46,"sequenceScore":1.9935,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["走路的时候感觉有点奇怪啊？","坐下的时候感觉有点奇怪啊？","今天这双鞋的颜色有点奇怪啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["敏俊，你鞋底粘着一片树叶。","敏俊，你鞋底粘着口香糖呢。","敏俊，你衣服上粘着口香糖。"],"answer":1}]}
